// The alert expression for rejected samples, evaluated centrally.
// rate() of a counter returns to zero after a burst; the raw total stays
// raised until Prometheus restarts. step=1m is a range query: a point a
// minute across the date picker, like the Graph tab in Prometheus.
PROMQL index=${DATA_STREAM} step=1m
  rate(prometheus_remote_storage_samples_failed_total[2m])
